<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n50658" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱππ-άζομαι</span></b> , 
			Dor.
		
		fut.
		3sg.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱππασεῖται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Dialex.</u>
					6.4
				</span></i>
			:—<i>drive horses, drive a chariot</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀντίλοχ᾽, ἀφραδέως ἱππάζεαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					23.426
				</span></i>
			; later, <i>ride</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				4.114
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
			</span></i><i>Aër.</i><i><span class="en">
				17
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Nu.</u>
				15
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱ. ἐφ᾽ ἵππων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					4.110
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἵππῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Eq.</u>
					10.1
				</span></i>
			: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁ ξυσμὰ ἐκ ποδὸς εἰς κεφαλὰν
					ἱππάζεται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sophr.
					53
				</span></i>
			:—rare in 
				Act.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱππάσαι πῶλον</span>
				ap.<i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				1.182
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, of the horse, <i>to be ridden</i> or <i>driven</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ion</u>
				540e
			</span></i>; <i>to be broken in for riding</i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				3.1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> c. acc.
			loci, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱππάζεσθαι χώραν</span>
			<i>ride over</i> a country, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Cam.</u>
				23
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς ὁδούς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					13.88
				</span></i>
			.</div>
